_This is an example "done" project so you can see how a finished job turns into a thank-you page. Edit it with your real spring workday content, add the names of everyone who pitched in and any business logos, or delete it from the CMS._

A brilliant turnout at the spring workday meant we got through a long list of small jobs - weeding, painting, clearing and general tidying. The site is looking all the better for it.

**With huge thanks to everyone who gave their time.**
